  "description": "The Repentance Before Death is a webnovel widely hated for its awful quality. This never kept Yul-jeong Kwon from loving the series...until the author decided to kill off her favorite character. Ready to fight for her fave, Yul-jeong borrowed a backhoe to wreck the writer’s house. Unfortunately, she met with an accident and, when she opened her eyes, found herself in the world of her favorite webnovel as Mitchelle Nephthys, one of its most notorious villains.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
